      "code": "template<typename T>\nauto compute_waiting_times(std::vector<T>& service_times)\n{\n    std::vector<T> W(service_times.size());\n    W[0] = 0;\n    for (auto i = 1; i < service_times.size(); i++)\n        W[i] = W[i - 1] + service_times[i - 1];\n    return W;\n}",
